%I A397546 #30 Aug 16 2026 17:57:27
%S A397546 1,1,5,37,319,3059,31195,331991,3643790,40943462,468641992,5444876910,
%T A397546 64046065940,761195559400,9127097466434,110274074021448,
%U A397546 1341196725790667,16407463043859695,201758372081210401,2492418559266719699,30917542391321559702,384953932253291489799,4809300966356268825598
%N A397546 Number of rooted unlabeled 8-gonal cacti having n blocks.
%C A397546 No closed form is known for the critical value or the radius of convergence.
%H A397546 Frédéric G. Speyser, <a href="/A397546/b397546.txt">Table of n, a(n) for n = 0..99</a>
%H A397546 Frederic G. Speyser, <a href="https://github.com/frederic-speyser/non-plane-mgonal-cacti">mgonal_cactus_series.py</a>
%F A397546 G.f. s(x) satisfies s(x) = x + x*(exp(Sum_{i>=1} K_C(x^i)/i) - 1), with K_C(x) = (1/2)*(s(x)^7 + s(x)*s(x^2)^3).
%o A397546 (Python) # See Links
%o A397546 (PARI) EulerT(v)={Vec(exp(x*Ser(dirmul(v, vector(#v, n, 1/n))))-1, -#v)}
%o A397546 seq(n)={my(v=[]); for(n=1, n, my(g=1+x*Ser(v)); v=EulerT(Vec((g^7 + g*subst(g^3, x, x^2))/2))); concat([1], v)}
%Y A397546 Column k=8 of A332648.
%K A397546 nonn,new
%O A397546 0,3
